    "root": {
      "type": "root",
      "markdown": "# Naming the thing\n\nForty minutes, three people, one whiteboard. Nothing was decided.\n\n**Pad colour is who wrote it** — that is the only thing colour means here. Click a note for what was actually said about it.\n\nThe red ring marks the one the room went quiet for. The squiggle marks the one that will not survive legal."
    },

    "title": {
      "type": "text", "x": 20, "y": 16, "w": 620, "h": 46,
      "text": "Naming the thing",
      "style": { "fontSize": 34 }
    },
    "rule": {
      "type": "draw", "x": 20, "y": 62, "w": 420, "h": 10,
      "points": [0, 0.7, 0.25, 0.25, 0.5, 0.85, 0.75, 0.2, 1, 0.6],
      "style": { "stroke": "#2563eb", "strokeWidth": 3 }
    },
    "subtitle": {
      "type": "text", "x": 20, "y": 78, "w": 700, "h": 28,
      "text": "Product sync, 14 March. Pad colour = who wrote it.",
      "style": { "textColor": "#64748b", "fontSize": 16 }
    },

    "col-a": { "type": "text", "x": 40, "y": 140, "w": 210, "h": 28, "text": "Ada", "style": { "fontSize": 18, "textColor": "#d97706" } },
    "col-b": { "type": "text", "x": 340, "y": 140, "w": 210, "h": 28, "text": "Bo", "style": { "fontSize": 18, "textColor": "#2563eb" } },
    "col-c": { "type": "text", "x": 640, "y": 140, "w": 210, "h": 28, "text": "Cyd", "style": { "fontSize": 18, "textColor": "#7c3aed" } },

    "a1": {
      "type": "sticky", "x": 40, "y": 180, "w": 210, "h": 118, "rotation": -2,
      "text": "Lantern",
      "markdown": "**Ada:** \"it is a thing you carry into a dark place.\"\n\nThe room liked it. Bo said three dev tools are already called this. Nobody checked."
    },
    "a2": { "type": "sticky", "x": 40, "y": 314, "w": 210, "h": 118, "rotation": 1.5, "text": "Ledger", "markdown": "Accurate and dead on arrival. It sounds like accounting software, because it is what accounting software is called." },
    "a3": { "type": "sticky", "x": 40, "y": 448, "w": 210, "h": 118, "rotation": -1, "text": "Northwind", "markdown": "Rejected in eleven seconds: it is the sample database everybody learned SQL on." },

    "b1": {
      "type": "sticky", "x": 340, "y": 180, "w": 210, "h": 118, "rotation": -2,
      "text": "Beacon",
      "markdown": "**Bo:** Ada's lantern, but it stays put and other people steer by it.\n\nSame metaphor, one syllable shorter, already a Cloudflare product.",
      "style": { "fill": "#dbeafe", "stroke": "#2563eb" }
    },
    "b2": { "type": "sticky", "x": 340, "y": 314, "w": 210, "h": 118, "rotation": 1.5, "text": "Hatch", "style": { "fill": "#dbeafe", "stroke": "#2563eb" }, "markdown": "Nice verb, unfortunate noun. Half the room heard a car boot." },
    "b3": { "type": "sticky", "x": 340, "y": 448, "w": 210, "h": 118, "rotation": -1, "text": "Otter", "style": { "fill": "#dbeafe", "stroke": "#2563eb" }, "markdown": "The animal-name floor. Every brainstorm reaches it around minute twenty-five." },

    "c1": {
      "type": "sticky", "x": 640, "y": 180, "w": 210, "h": 118, "rotation": -2,
      "text": "Fathom",
      "markdown": "**Cyd:** depth and understanding in one word.\n\nThis is where the room went quiet, which is the closest thing to agreement that happened.",
      "style": { "fill": "#ede9fe", "stroke": "#7c3aed" }
    },
    "c2": { "type": "sticky", "x": 640, "y": 314, "w": 210, "h": 118, "rotation": 1.5, "text": "Deepwell", "style": { "fill": "#ede9fe", "stroke": "#7c3aed" }, "markdown": "Taken, and the holder makes oil field software. Legal will not enjoy this one." },
    "c3": { "type": "sticky", "x": 640, "y": 448, "w": 210, "h": 118, "rotation": -1, "text": "Quarry", "style": { "fill": "#ede9fe", "stroke": "#7c3aed" }, "markdown": "You dig in it and you hunt it. Both readings are on brand, which is one more than most of these." },

